ments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Legendary_Wand_of_the_Temple%27s_Eternal_Flame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Legendary_Wand_of_the_Temple%27s_Eternal_Flame.png/420px-Legendary_Wand_of_the_Temple%27s_Eternal_Flame.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"585\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Legendary_Wand_of_the_Temple%27s_Eternal_Flame.png 1.5x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">\n<p>Not upgradeable \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><i>A thin rod of blackened wood containing charges of the Flaming Bolt spell. Eternal wands recharge over time if they are not actively being used.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span>\n<p><b>Bug: </b> All eternal wands in ToEE spawn with <a href=\"/page/Spellcasting_Implement\" title=\"Spellcasting Implement\">Spellcasting Implement</a> enchantment that vanishes after first relog.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817053917\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.093 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.098 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4274/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29046/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9898/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 17/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   80.560      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   80.560      1 -total\n 97.89%   78.861      1 Template:Eternal_wand\n 35.07%   28.252      7 Template:Popup\n 22.38%   18.028      1 Template:Mat\n 18.07%   14.561      1 Template:Augment\n 13.45%   10.832      1 Template:Non-food\n 12.42%   10.002      1 Template:Red\n 11.51%    9.269     52 Template:IO\n 10.15%    8.176      1 Template:Color\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:97523-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817053917 and revision id 633165. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
